  {
    "n": 13,
    "title": "DAG if-then-else 编译产物正确压栈",
    "slug": "dag-if-then-else",
    "kind": "positive",
    "purpose": "真实 L3 输出常是混合多指令的 children 序列：5 步 [op_file_read, cs, op_move, sn, op_write] 逆序压栈。",
    "preparation": "createMockL3(5 entries 混合 execute_op/conditional_skip/skip_n)\nentry={type:'read_or_create_file'}",
    "assertion": "stack=[entry, op_write, sn, op_move, cs, op_file_read]",
    "note": "DAG 编译产物的真实场景——5 步混合指令。",
    "subfig": {
      "name": "dag-stacking.puml",
      "title": "DAG 编译产物逆序压栈时序",
      "body": "@startuml\ntitle Subfigure: #13 DAG 编译产物逆序压栈时序\n\nparticipant L3 as L\nparticipant executeIntent as EI\ndatabase state.stack as ST\n\nL -> L : compile(intent)\nL --> EI : children = [op_file_read, cs, op_move, sn, op_write]\nnote right of EI\n  5 条 children\n  children[0]=op_file_read（最先执行）\n  children[4]=op_write（最后执行）\nend note\n\nEI -> ST : push op_write\nEI -> ST : push sn\nEI -> ST : push op_move\nEI -> ST : push cs\nEI -> ST : push op_file_read\n\nnote over ST\n  栈（底→顶）:\n  [entry, op_write, sn, op_move, cs, op_file_read]\nend note\n\nEI -> ST : entry.phase = 'awaiting_children'\n\n@enduml\n"
    },
    "view": "stack",
    "state": {
      "stack_before": [
        "entry"
      ],
      "stack_after": [
        "entry",
        "op_write",
        "sn",
        "op_move",
        "cs",
        "op_file_read"
      ],
      "int_before": null,
      "int_after": null,
      "pub_before": null,
      "pub_after": null,
      "entry_before": "pending",
      "entry_after": "awaiting_children",
      "error": null
    },
    "action": "L3.compile 5 步 children\n逆序压栈"
  },
